        "title": "Unchecked type assertions in DrawMeasured can panic the render path",
        "message": "DrawMeasured uses unchecked type assertions on the composer and on `ps.renderer`. Any other composer or renderer implementation panics inside the render/compose path, and only when diagnostics are enabled. The opt-in diagnostic path should not be able to crash the UI. The same pattern is repeated in scrimSource and fillInsetsSource.",
        "suggestion": "Use the comma-ok form. If the assertion fails, fall back to `ps.Draw(c)` and return a SourceTiming with the availability flags false, so the source is still drawn exactly once and nothing panics.",
